# Marvin, Murderous Mimic: "If an activated ability ... references the card it's printed on by name, treat Marvin's version of
# that ability as though it referenced Marvin instead" (the ruling; CR 113.7, 201.5). Bot1 controls Blazing Rootwalla ("{R}:
# Blazing Rootwalla gets +2/+0 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn."). Marvin's copy, paid with Mox Ruby, pumps
# Marvin (4/2), not the Rootwalla (still 1/1); the Rootwalla's own, paid from Black Lotus, pumps it (3/1). The "once each turn"
# is each object's own (CR 602.5b): Marvin's second activation is refused with {R}{R} still in the pool.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Blazing Rootwalla
Marvin, Murderous Mimic
Mountain x13

